{"id":"契字","split":"dev","family":"ownership","style":"明确交代与对照","rows":[{"text":"后院一直由程希独占。","setup":true,"asOf":1,"visual":false},{"text":"晒架搁在墙角。","asOf":2,"visual":false},{"text":"门外传来脚步，来人却走过了。","asOf":3,"visual":false},{"text":"程希为药铺签下后院转让书，尚未生效。","claim":{"kind":"ownership","actor":"程希","other":"药铺","item":"后院","before":"old-holder","after":"transferred","polarity":"positive","source":"narrator","time":"current","qualifier":"unconditional"},"verdict":"unresolved","review":true,"event":false,"deps":[1],"why":"程希为药铺签下后院转让书，尚未生效。","asOf":4,"visual":false,"span":[0,18]},{"text":"来人量了门宽。","asOf":5,"visual":false},{"text":"「要是明天有个准信就好了。」","asOf":6,"visual":false},{"text":"等消息的人起身，又坐回原处。","asOf":7,"visual":false},{"text":"夜里下了一阵雨。","asOf":8,"visual":false},{"text":"第二天，廊边多了几道浅浅的水痕。","asOf":9,"visual":false},{"text":"到了月底，谁也没有再来敲那扇门。","asOf":10,"visual":false},{"text":"复核发现程希的签名系冒签，药铺从未取得后院产权。","claim":{"kind":"ownership","actor":"程希","other":"药铺","item":"后院","before":"old-holder","after":"transferred","polarity":"positive","source":"narrator","time":"current","qualifier":"unconditional"},"verdict":"contradicted","review":false,"event":false,"deps":[1],"why":"复核发现程希的签名系冒签，药铺从未取得后院产权。","asOf":11,"visual":false,"span":[0,24]},{"text":"老槐树开了花。","asOf":12,"visual":false}],"rank":[]}
